                <dashboardComponentContents>
                    <richTextContent>[{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;bold\&amp;quot;:true},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;Note:\&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;align\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;left\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;\\n\&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;1) \&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;bold\&amp;quot;:true},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;Audit \&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;needed \&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;bold\&amp;quot;:true},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;if Account Owner = Uncovered\&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot; then need Sales CRM Data Ops review account record if Sales Group should change or assign owner\&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;align\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;left\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;\\n\&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;2) \&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;bold\&amp;quot;:true},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;If there is no \&amp;#39;Stamped\&amp;#39; value in Unified Global Name\&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;, then we do not yet have a recommendation for who the customer is matching to and \&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;bold\&amp;quot;:true},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;need help identifying the min. customer info.\&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;align\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;left\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;\\n\&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;color\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;#0d33b6\&amp;quot;,\&amp;quot;size\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;16px\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;3) If customer is on Sales Org. Hierarchy for KPI Hosted, then Sales KPI DBs &amp;amp; KPI &amp;amp; Commission scoring is dep. on the UCD Global\/Intermediate IDs &amp;amp; \\\&amp;quot;hosted\\\&amp;quot; SalesGroup\&amp;quot;},{\&amp;quot;attributes\&amp;quot;:{\&amp;quot;align\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;left\&amp;quot;},\&amp;quot;insert\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;\\n\&amp;quot;}]</richTextContent>
